#
# Description:
#   - Call variants from BQSR-applied RNA-seq BAM files using GATK HaplotypeCaller
#   - Generate a genomic VCF (GVCF) for each sample
#   - Apply GATK standard and allele-specific annotations
#   - Index the generated GVCF files for downstream joint genotyping
#
# Input:
#   - BQSR-applied RNA-seq BAM files
#   - GRCh38 reference genome
#
# Output:
#   - Per-sample GVCF files (.vcf.gz)
#   - GVCF index files (.tbi)
#
# Usage:
#   cat NEW_All_samples.txt | parallel -j 8 ../../Scripts/05C_GATK-3.sh
#
# Software:
#   - GATK
#   - BCFtools
#   - BGZIP
#   - Tabix
#############################################################################################
#############################################################################################

